Package: blueberry-pie-os-kernel
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Priority: required
Depends: base-files (>= 6), kext-tools (>= 2)
Breaks: blueberry-pie-os-boot (<< 1.3)
Provides: pie-zfs-abi (= 2.4)
Description: the xnu kernels for the Pi 4, the Pi 5 and the RK3566
 xnu's DEVELOPMENT kernels for the BCM2711, BCM2712 and RK3566, for the
 boot partition, in one bundle that pieboot loads. With them come the kexts
 the kernel loads first: the networking, serial and FAT families and the
 board's drivers.

Package: blueberry-pie-os-kernel-dev
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Section: devel
Description: files for building kexts against the kernels
 The kernel SDK's headers and libcc_kext, and each kernel's System.kext,
 for building kexts with pietoolchain's kext.mk.
